{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And they spied.</b> Like 'to search out all the land,' for the one who digs searches for what is hidden." "<b>Which we shall come to them.</b> At the beginning."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra connects ויחפרו to the root חפר 'to dig,' glossing it via החופר 'the digger,' and explains the semantic link between digging and searching."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:21:52.240755772Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}